// Plover Sedan body: a late-90s mid-size family sedan of the rounded "jellybean" school.
//
// Intent: no straight line anywhere. A low rounded nose with a thin slot between oval-ish
// swept lamps, a short hood falling into a long raked windshield, a high arched roof that
// runs down into a short, tall, rounded deck, a soft rising beltline and smooth
// body-colored bumpers with no rub strips. Black window frames, plain five-spoke wheels
// for the better trims, steel wheels with covers for the rest. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
